        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hey all,</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Quick question, are the tokens included in the Extra Token Pack the same ones that are in the Enhanced Edition box (just dups) or are there additional ones that are useful during play?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">The enhanced edition is on its way and I&#39;m wondering if I should have ordered the token pack also. &nbsp;</span>I&#39;m not sure if the pack is meant for purchasers of the 1st Edition, which didn&#39;t come with any, or if they extend the Enhanced Edition also.</p><p>If its the latter, is the token pack available for purchase at retail stores or online only?</p><p>Thx</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
