      {
        "id": 66186,
        "name": "Silverleaf",
        "username": "Silverleaf",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-18T08:20:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The token pack contains the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1HP, 5HP, and 10HP tokens (same as the ones included in the Enhanced Edition box)</li>\n<li>+1 damage and -1 damage tokens (same as EE)</li>\n<li>Start of turn/end of turn tokens (NOT included in EE)</li>\n</ul>\nSo I guess the only reason to buy it is for the start/end tokens, unless you find you desperately need more of the others. I made my own start/end tokens and they are really helpful to stop you forgetting effects that are easy to miss when you skim the cards.\n<p>I also have Spiff's <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/universal_effects.pdf\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Universal Effects Tracker</a> which can cut down the number of tokens you need in play quite a lot, and makes everything neater.</p>\n<p>Hope that helps!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:43:49.755Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
